uildings, pedestrians, horse carriages, horse riders, street vendors, and authentic historical daily life atmosphere.\n\nsummary:\n\nCreate a 15-second cinematic ultra-realistic time travel short film.\nA modern young male office worker from Reference Image 1 enters the elevator from Reference Image 2, discovers and presses the mysterious horizontal \"8\" infinity button, travels through time, exits into the Han Dynasty street from Reference Image 4, walks forward two steps, and unexpectedly sees the woman from Reference Image 3 walking toward him.\nThe video should feel like a high-budget realistic movie scene with strong contrast between modern technology and ancient history.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\nMaintain strict identity consistency:\n\n* Reference Image 1 male character must keep the exact same face, hairstyle, age, body proportions, and clothing in every shot.\n* Reference Image 3 female character must keep the exact same face, hairstyle, age, body proportions, and white shirt plus short skirt outfit when appearing.\n* Reference Image 2 elevator must preserve the exact button arrangement and especially the horizontal \"8\" infinity symbol button.\n* Reference Image 4 Han Dynasty street must preserve realistic historical architecture, clothing of ancient people, vehicles, and atmosphere.\n\nImportant visual continuity:\n\n* The male character's right hand must clearly press the horizontal 8 (∞) button.\n* After time travel, the male character must physically walk forward exactly two steps before seeing the woman.\n* The woman must also move toward the male character after noticing him.\n* Their meeting must feel like an emotional cinematic coincidence.\n\ndetailed_description:\n\n0-3 seconds:\n\nOpening shot.\nA modern office building corridor.\n\nThe male character from Reference Image 1 enters the elevator from Reference Image 2.\n\nCamera:\nCinematic tracking shot following him into the elevator.\n\nInside the elevator:\nThe man stands in front of the control panel.\nHe prepares to select a floor.\n\nShow:\nModern elevator interior.\nButton panel.\nProfessional office atmosphere.\n\n3-6 seconds:\n\nClose-up sequence.\n\nCamera moves into an extreme close-up of the elevator buttons.\n\nThe male character notices a strange button:\na horizontal number 8 infinity symbol (∞).\n\nHe looks surprised and curious.\n\nCritical action:\nThe male character raises his right hand.\nHis right index finger clearly presses the horizontal 8 (∞) button.\n\nShow clearly:\n\n* Finger touching the infinity button.\n* Button illumination.\n* Elevator lights flickering.\n* Subtle realistic spatial distortion.\n\nThe effect should be cinematic and realistic.\nNo exaggerated science fiction effects.\n\n6-9 seconds:\n\nTime travel transition.\n\nInside the elevator:\nThe lights stabilize.\n\nThe elevator doors slowly open.\n\nInstead of a modern office building,\nthe door reveals the Han Dynasty street from Reference Image 4.\n\nThe male character steps outside.\n\nCamera follows behind him.\n\nHe looks around in shock.\n\nShow:\n\n* Ancient shops.\n* Crowded streets.\n* Horse carriages passing.\n* Horse riders.\n* People walking.\n* Real historical daily life.\n\nCreate a strong visual contrast:\nmodern office worker inside ancient China.\n\n9-12 seconds:\n\nDiscovery scene.\n\nThe male character walks forward.\n\nImportant movement:\nAfter leaving the elevator,\nhe walks forward exactly two steps.\n\nStep one:\nHe observes the unfamiliar ancient street.\n\nStep two:\nHe suddenly notices someone familiar.\n\nCamera switches to his point of view.\n\nIn the crowd,\nhe sees the female character from Reference Image 3.\n\nShe is wearing the same modern white shirt and short skirt outfit,\nstanding in the middle of the Han Dynasty street.\n\nThe man's expression changes from curiosity to shock and disbelief.\n\n12-15 seconds:\n\nEmotional climax.\n\nThe woman notices the man.\n\nShe recognizes him.\n\nThe woman starts walking toward him.\n\nAt the same time,\nthe male character walks slowly toward her.\n\nThey move closer through the ancient street.\n\nA horse carriage passes between them,\ntemporarily blocking their view.\n\nAfter the carriage leaves,\nthey see each other again.\n\nCamera:\nSlow cinematic push-in.\nShallow depth of field.\nThe camera must obtain a clear, unobstructed close-up of the woman's face, matching Reference Image 3 exactly.\n\nFinal frame:\nThe two modern people stand together in the center of a Han Dynasty street,\nsurrounded by ancient architecture and crowds.\n\nA mysterious emotional reunion between two eras.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nRealistic cinematic environment sounds:\n\n* Elevator button click.\n* Elevator mechanical hum.\n* Soft electronic elevator sounds.\n* Subtle energy distortion sound during time travel.\n* Ancient marketplace atmosphere.\n* Footsteps on stone street.\n* Horse footsteps.\n* Wooden carriage wheels.\n* Crowd conversations.\n* Street vendors calling.\n* Natural city ambience.\n\nNo artificial futuristic sounds.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nCinematic orchestral background music.\n\nBeginning:\nMinimal modern suspense atmosphere.\n\nDuring infinity button press:\nMusic builds with mysterious tension.\n\nDuring time travel:\nSlow dramatic rise.\n\nDuring the reunion:\nEmotional cinematic strings.\n\nEnding:\nA powerful but subtle emotional resolution.\n\nNo lyrics.\nNo narration.\nNo subtitles.\nNo watermark.\n", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 8, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"